    "label": "Thm:LDP-UCB-L",
    "number": "Theorem (Thm:LDP-UCB-L)",
    "quote": "LDP-UCB-L is $\\epsilon$-LDP. Its distribution-dependent regret is at most \\sum_{a:\\Delta_a>0}\\Big[\\frac{8(1 + 4/\\epsilon)^2\\log{T}}{\\Delta_a} + \\Big(1 + \\frac{2\\pi^2}{3}\\Big)\\Delta_a\\Big] = O(...), and its distribution-free regret (for $T \\geq n$) is at most $O(\\epsilon^{-1}\\sqrt{nT\\log{T}})$."
   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "Paper's n is K. Horizon not assumed known (index does not use T). Also stated as O(sum (log T/(eps^2 Delta_a) + Delta_a)), which holds for eps bounded."
